        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" value="Enforcement conditions. RbacCheckMiddleware only evaluates requests whose path starts with a protected prefix: /api/alerts/, /api/outcomes/, /api/audit/list, /api/auth/whoami, /api/offline/replay, /api/recovery/handover. Unprotected paths bypass the matrix entirely. A missing AppRole claim yields 401; a role outside the closed set, a disallowed prefix, a missing persona_id, or a persona whose AIIMS function is outside the role's scope yields 403." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="1500" x="40" y="715" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" value="Role-label aliases. Operator-facing labels such as IC, Operations, Planning, Logistics, PIO and Auditor map to incident-commander, operations-officer, planning-officer, logistics-officer, public-information-officer and observer-auditor respectively. Claim normalisation accepts app_role, appRole, or the first entry of roles." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1500" x="40" y="805" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#9ca3af;fontSize=11;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" value="UNVERIFIED in this pass: production activation state of the spec-035 auth stack (AMA_ENABLE_PRODUCTION_AUTH), cloud-side EasyAuth configuration, and Entra app-role assignment in the directory. Test-principal injection is an isolated test mechanism and is never production evidence." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1500" x="40" y="875" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
